Command exited with status 1
{"status": "needs_fixes", "findings": ["Workspace cleanup waits for output EOF before stopping descendants. On macOS, a parent that exited 0 was reported as `limit_reached` after two seconds because its background child kept stdout open. Start coalition cleanup when the parent exits, preserve its exit status and buffered output, and add coverage for a child that inherits stdout. [src/commands.rs](https://github.com/takahirox/cognix/blob/e0bb614fa16f521926f7c886931ed0034cb4cfcb/src/commands.rs#L805)", "The default workspace profile passes the dependency-free Cargo fixture, but `cargo test --offline --locked --no-run` failed on Cognix itself because the sandbox uses an empty temporary Cargo home. The same command succeeded on the host with cached dependencies. Support and test a dependency-backed Cargo workflow using a workspace-scoped dependency source while preserving home isolation and default-denied networking. [src/commands.rs](https://github.com/takahirox/cognix/blob/e0bb614fa16f521926f7c886931ed0034cb4cfcb/src/commands.rs#L698)", "The build-script HTTP broker drops the `Location` header from redirects. A local 302 response was reported as completed, but the script received an empty body and no target it could submit for approval. Surface a validated redirect target and require a separate policy and approval check before contacting it. Add a regression for the brokered redirect path. [src/commands.rs](https://github.com/takahirox/cognix/blob/e0bb614fa16f521926f7c886931ed0034cb4cfcb/src/commands.rs#L605)"], "questions": [], "pr": {"number": 31, "url": "https://github.com/takahirox/cognix/pull/31", "head_sha": "e0bb614fa16f521926f7c886931ed0034cb4cfcb"}}
Review or merge needs inspection before further work.

